n.qq.com/s/HQlUFTnZTRBfIfutsOiavA\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"1576ab4179727b3d\">>>","published":"2024-05-22 15:53:00","siteName":"www.douyin.com"},{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"e397a238b7a88c4c\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\n创建第一个小程序1,进入微信公众平台,点立即注册,注册个人开发者https://mp.weixin.qq.com注册成功 - 掘金\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"e397a238b7a88c4c\">>>","url":"https://juejin.cn/post/6844903922105057294","description":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"b66aa7bf8702e8d6\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\n1,进入微信公众平台,点立即注册,注册个人开发者https://mp.weixin.qq.com注册成功后点击小程序登录后点击进入设置页面点击左边的开发-》开发设置复制好自己的appId这个id以...\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"b66aa7bf8702e8d6\">>>","published":"2019-08-22 14:32:04","siteName":"juejin.cn"}]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1778291209190}}
{"type":"message","id":"2edea148","parentId":"29d402c0","timestamp":"2026-05-09T01:47:03.068Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The search didn't find the specific article. The article is behind a WeChat CAPTCHA - it requires WeChat authentication to view. This is a common anti-scraping measure. Let me explain this to the user.\n","thinkingSignature":"d56571ed0fe928fa279726804c3d33d9d02498adec01a91be12bceca5fc78325"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n这篇文章在微信公众平台（mp.weixin.qq.com）上，现在被访问验证拦住了——打开时直接跳转到了一个验证码页面，需要在微信内置浏览器中验证身份才能继续阅读。\n\n**原因：** 微信公众号的链接默认不允许非微信环境直接抓取，会弹出\"环境异常\"等验证页，这是微信的防爬机制。\n\n**如果想看这篇内容，有几个办法：**\n\n1. **直接在微信里打开** — 复制链接 `https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/svac4tmdCl8Gp9kcvdV2OQ` 发给自己，在微信里点开就能看\n\n2. **在电脑微信客户端打开** — 登录PC微信，把链接粘贴到文件传输助手，再点击\n\n3. **告诉我文章标题或关键词** — 如果你知道这篇文章大概是什么主题，我可以帮你搜到相关内容\n\n你方便哪种方式？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":1456,"output":227,"cacheRead":25664,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":27347,"cost":{"input":0.0004368,"output":0.0002724,"cacheRead":0.0015398399999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00224904}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778291209191,"responseId":"064dc5092ed1143574f010f90f8e0634"}}
