{"type":"custom_message","customType":"openclaw.runtime-context","content":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"o9cq802dCUlbYIrFHu3-NkzTM0xk@im.wechat\",\n  \"message_id\": \"openclaw-weixin:1778291805991-d4249662\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sat 2026-05-09 09:56 GMT+8\"\n}\n```","display":false,"details":{"source":"openclaw-runtime-context"},"id":"4defe807","parentId":"1b5a25cf","timestamp":"2026-05-09T01:56:48.007Z"}
{"type":"message","id":"3d799b30","parentId":"4defe807","timestamp":"2026-05-09T01:56:56.007Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking what browser I used to open the link. Looking at the browser tool, I used `action=open` with `target=\"host\"`, which according to the tool description uses \"the isolated OpenClaw-managed browser\". So it was the OpenClaw browser on the host machine.\n\nLet me answer this directly.","thinkingSignature":"224b7358521626d207cf1629636e21dffccdd36a3c6047dd38f2a2e8af657541"},{"type":"text","text":"我是用 OpenClaw 自己托管的隔离浏览器打开的（`target=\"host\"`），不是你的本地浏览器。\n\n具体流程是：\n\n- OpenClaw 在服务器/主机上启动一个独立的 Chromium 浏览器实例\n- 用那个浏览器去访问 `mp.weixin.qq.com`\n- 微信检测到是\"非微信客户端\"的 User-Agent，直接弹出了验证码页面\n\n所以问题不在于\"浏览器不对\"，而是 **微信公众平台强制要求在微信内置浏览器中打开**，任何第三方浏览器（包括独立的 Chromium）都会被拦截。\n\n这和用你自己的微信客户端打开不一样——微信客户端里访问公众号文章是登录态，微信公众平台认可；但通过程序控制的浏览器是\"游客\"身份，微信会拦截。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":143,"output":221,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":27279,"totalTokens":27643,"cost":{"input":0.0000429,"output":0.0002652,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0.010229625000000001,"total":0.010537725000000001}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778291808007,"responseId":"064dc7602060eb1526efc07760b7343c"}}
