width: 7px;height: 7px;background: =\r\nrgb(251, 211, 55);border-radius: 50%;margin-bottom: -5px;margin-left: auto;=\r\nz-index: 1;\" class=3D\"js_darkmode__21\"></section><section style=3D\"width: 2=\r\n4px;height: 24px;background: rgb(7, 110, 238);border-radius: 50%;display: f=\r\nlex;align-items: center;justify-content: center;\" class=3D\"js_darkmode__22\"=\r\n><p style=3D\"font-size: 17px;color: white;text-align: center;margin: 0;line=\r\n-height: 24px;\">4</p></section></section><section style=3D\"margin-left: 6px=\r\n;font-size: 17px;color: rgb(7, 110, 238);font-weight: bold;\">=EF=BD=9C=E5=\r\n=AE=9E=E6=88=98=E6=BC=94=E7=A4=BA=EF=BC=9A=E7=94=A8 playwright-cli =E6=93=\r\n=8D=E6=8E=A7 TodoMVC</section></section></section><p style=3D\"margin-bottom=\r\n: 0px;margin-top: 16px;\"><span leaf=3D\"\" style=3D\"font-family: Optima-Regul=\r\nar, PingFangTC-light;\">=E6=9D=A5=E4=B8=80=E6=AE=B5=E7=9C=9F=E5=AE=9E=E7=9A=\r\n=84=E6=93=8D=E4=BD=9C=E8=AE=B0=E5=BD=95=E3=80=82=E5=AE=89=E8=A3=85=E5=AE=8C=\r\n=E6=88=90=E5=90=8E=EF=BC=8C=E7=94=A8=E4=BB=A5=E4=B8=8B=E5=91=BD=E4=BB=A4=E5=\r\n=BA=8F=E5=88=97=E6=8E=A7=E5=88=B6=E6=B5=8F=E8=A7=88=E5=99=A8=E5=AE=8C=E6=88=\r\n=90 TodoMVC =E5=86=99=E5=85=A5=E6=B5=81=E7=A8=8B=EF=BC=9A</span></p><sectio=\r\nn style=3D\"margin: 12px 0;padding: 12px 16px;background: #f8f8f8;border-rad=\r\nius: 4px;\" class=3D\"js_darkmode__23\"><p style=3D\"margin: 0;font-family: Men=\r\nlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace;font-size: 13px;color: #333;line-height: 1.=\r\n8;white-space: pre-wrap;\" class=3D\"js_darkmode__24\"># =E6=89=93=E5=BC=80=E6=\r\n=BC=94=E7=A4=BA=E9=A1=B5=E9=9D=A2\r\n$ playwright-cli open https://demo.playwright.dev/todomvc\r\n\r\n# =E7=94=A8 snapshot =E6=89=BE=E5=88=B0=E8=BE=93=E5=85=A5=E6=A1=86 ref\r\n$ playwright-cli snapshot\r\n\n[72032 more lines in file. Use offset=1109 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1778292192980}}
{"type":"message","id":"27ef1731","parentId":"0e181d5a","timestamp":"2026-05-09T02:03:31.634Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have the full article content. It's a Chinese article about Microsoft's playwright-cli. Let me provide a comprehensive summary in Chinese since the user wrote to me in Chinese.","thinkingSignature":"e48d7d995036b324393bdda01b37f62feb3921a88b54131365417fd9c94d5980"},{"type":"text","text":"这篇文章来自微信公众号 **「阑了阑」**，标题是：\n\n# 浏览器不再只是人类的工具——微软 playwright-cli 深度解析\n\n---\n\n## 文章概要\n\n当 AI Agent 开始\"接管\"你的浏览器，测试自动化浪潮迎来一场安静的革命。微软开源的 playwright-cli，让 AI 也能优雅地上网。\n\n### 1. 它是什么？与 MCP 说起\n\n你可能用过 Playwright MCP——让 Claude 直接操控浏览器做自动化。但 MCP 有一个\"甜蜜的烦恼\"：每次操作都要把整个页面状态塞进 LLM 的上下文窗口，Token 消耗巨大，Agent 的\"大脑\"很快就被页面信息填满了。\n\nplaywright-cli 的出现，专门解决这个痛点。它是微软推出命令行工具，把浏览器操作解析成一个极简的 CLI 命令，让 AI Agent 可以像\"发短指令\"一样控制浏览器——每条命令只返回必要信息，不强制把整个页面倒进上下文。\n\n> *\"A command-line interface for browser automation designed for coding agents. Token-efficient commands and installable skills let agents balance browser automation with large codebases and reasoning within limited context windows.\"*\n\n### 2. 8400+ 星的项目长什么样\n\n- GitHub: `microsoft/playwright-cli`，目前 **8.4k Stars / 394 Forks**\n- 昨天刚更新到 v1.60.0-alpha\n- 项目结构包含 `.claude/skills/dev/`（Claude Code 集成的 skill 定义）、`skills/playwright-cli/`（可安装的 Agent skill 包）、`tests/`、`scripts/` 等\n\n### 3. 5分钟上手：安装与核心命令\n\n**安装：**\n```bash\nnpm install -g @playwright/cli@latest\nplaywright-cli install --skills  # 安装浏览器 + skill 文件\n```\n\n**核心命令分为 8 大类：**\n\n**🗣 导航类**\n```bash\nplaywright-cli open https://example.com   # 打开浏览器\nplaywright-cli goto https://news.ycombinator.com  # 跳转新 URL\nplaywright-cli go-back  # 后退\nplaywright-cli reload   # 刷新\n```\n\n**🔁 交互类**\n```bash\nplaywright-cli snapshot     # 捕获页面语义树 + 元素 ref\nplaywright-cli click e21    # 点击（ref 来自 snapshot）\nplaywright-cli fill e35 \"关键词\"  # 填写输入框\nplaywright-cli press Enter  # 按键\nplaywright-cli check e42    # 勾选复选框\n```\n\n> **关键设计**：snapshot 返回 Accessibility Tree（语义树），元素带 ref 编号（如 e21），后续命令直接引用 ref——比 CSS/XPath 选择器稳定 10 倍，AI 也更容易理解。\n\n### 4. 实战演示：操控 TodoMVC\n\n文章还演示了用 playwright-cli 控制 TodoMVC 的完整操作流，包括如何用 snapshot 找到输入框 ref、添加待办事项、勾选完成等步骤。\n\n---\n\n**总结：** playwright-cli 是微软为 AI 时代打造的浏览器操控工具，核心理念是\"Token 高效、命令简洁、语义清晰\"，让 AI Agent 在控制浏览器时不被海量页面信息淹没。适合用来做自动化测试、网页数据采集、AI 操控浏览器等场景。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":39962,"output":714,"cacheRead":18026,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":58702,"cost":{"input":0.0119886,"output":0.0008568,"cacheRead":0.0010815599999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.01392696}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778292192982,"responseId":"064dc8e1a4024ca3e575c90ed416fea6"}}
