{"type":"message","id":"bef849aa","parentId":"1267acca","timestamp":"2026-05-09T02:04:35.235Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking why this time I was able to see the WeChat article content. Looking at the conversation, the user attached the article as an MHT file (web archive format) - they saved the page from VIA browser and sent it as an attachment. That's why I could read it - it's a local file attachment, not a live URL fetch.\n\nWhen I tried earlier, I was trying to fetch the live URL which got blocked by WeChat's verification page. But the user sent the actual saved page file, which bypasses that entire issue.","thinkingSignature":"3aec32a677d36c743f472ce2550d7bc2b081117e74b506c245508a06805e7482"},{"type":"text","text":"因为这次你把**文章页面直接作为文件发给我了**（.mht 格式），而不是让我自己去抓链接。\n\n之前你给我的是 URL：`https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/svac4tmdCl8Gp9kcvdV2OQ`——我去请求那个链接，微信检测到是自动化浏览器，直接弹验证页。\n\n这次你从 VIA 浏览器里把页面**另存为 MHT 文件**（网页归档），然后直接发过来。我读取本地文件，绕过了\"请求 → 微信拦截\"这个过程，所以能直接看到内容。\n\n---\n\n**区别就是：**\n\n| 方式 | 我怎么拿到内容 |\n|------|--------------|\n| 你发 URL | 我去请求 → 微信拦截 → 失败 |\n| 你发 MHT 文件 | 我直接读本地文件 → 成功 |\n\nVIA 浏览器能保存完整页面（包括正文和图片引用），所以我读到的内容和你在 VIA 里看到的基本一样。这就是为什么之前抓不到、这次能抓到。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":143,"output":324,"cacheRead":18026,"cacheWrite":25686,"totalTokens":44179,"cost":{"input":0.0000429,"output":0.00038879999999999996,"cacheRead":0.0010815599999999999,"cacheWrite":0.00963225,"total":0.01114551}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778292262045,"responseId":"064dc926cd4b22b9df30cce0d5c5720f"}}
