{"type":"message","id":"e1b83913","parentId":"ae4f5c0c","timestamp":"2026-05-09T02:13:02.938Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants a brief summary of the image content. The image is a GitHub page showing the Scrapling project documentation in Chinese. Let me give a concise summary.","thinkingSignature":"1b5d771abde67b64d032272ce8c6a4a6c79177fd792e92cf6653cc60f2e9943a"},{"type":"text","text":"这是 GitHub 上一个叫 **Scrapling** 的 Python 爬虫框架的中文文档页面，主要信息：\n\n- **定位**：自适应 Web 爬虫框架，主打\"现代网页轻松抓取\"\n- **数据**：月下载 55.9 万次，pypi 0.4.7\n- **亮点功能**：\n  - 解析器能\"学习\"网站结构变化，不怕网页改版\n  - 内置反 Cloudflare 等反爬机制\n  - 支持并发、自动代理轮换、多 Session\n- **提供两种接口**：StealthyFetcher（隐身抓取）+ Spider（爬虫类）\n- 配套有 Agent Skill、CLI、MCP 模式\n\n简单说就是一个**面向 AI 时代的 Python 爬虫工具**，能绕过反爬、适应网页变化，适合和 AI Agent 配合使用。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":143,"output":213,"cacheRead":45062,"cacheWrite":1310,"totalTokens":46728,"cost":{"input":0.0000429,"output":0.0002556,"cacheRead":0.0027037199999999997,"cacheWrite":0.00049125,"total":0.00349347}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778292777323,"responseId":"064dcb293e15f7ff032d1fc4139c5f1e"}}
