{"type":"custom_message","customType":"openclaw.runtime-context","content":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"o9cq802dCUlbYIrFHu3-NkzTM0xk@im.wechat\",\n  \"message_id\": \"openclaw-weixin:1778292829334-409067f5\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sat 2026-05-09 10:13 GMT+8\"\n}\n```","display":false,"details":{"source":"openclaw-runtime-context"},"id":"71dc6867","parentId":"b55700a1","timestamp":"2026-05-09T02:13:51.344Z"}
{"type":"message","id":"143b3162","parentId":"71dc6867","timestamp":"2026-05-09T02:14:07.142Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking whether Scrapling is suitable for scraping WeChat public account articles. Let me think about this.\n\nFrom what I know about WeChat public accounts (公众号):\n1. The articles are on `mp.weixin.qq.com` which requires WeChat browser environment to access\n2. WeChat has strong anti-bot measures - it checks User-Agent, cookies, login status, etc.\n3. The content is dynamically rendered via JavaScript\n4. WeChat uses verification/captcha for non-WeChat browsers\n\nScrapling, despite being a good web scraping framework, would face the same fundamental issue that I faced when trying to access the article - WeChat's platform-level blocking. \n\nEven with stealth features like rotating user agents and proxies, Scrapling can't bypass the fact that WeChat requires login status and specific browser characteristics that Scrapling isn't designed to handle.","thinkingSignature":"4c615fe462fb0b4a940485260024ca71c4cfb9cbbf306185f97599e10b4df765"},{"type":"text","text":"说实话——**不太适合**。\n\n微信公众号文章的核心问题不是\"爬虫技术\"，而是**微信平台的封锁**：\n\n## 微信的反爬机制\n\n1. **必须微信内置浏览器环境** — 普通浏览器（包括 Scrapling）访问 `mp.weixin.qq.com`，微信直接返回验证码页面，不管你用什么技术\n2. **强制登录态验证** — 即使绕过了验证码，文章内容接口也需要有效的微信登录态 Cookie\n3. **IP 信任机制** — 服务器 IP 段更容易被微信标记为\"可疑\"\n\n## Scrapling 能做的\n\n- 绕过 Cloudflare、Turnstile 等常见反爬\n- 处理动态渲染 JS 的页面\n- 自动适应网页结构变化\n\n## Scrapling 做不到的\n\n- 伪造微信内置浏览器的登录态\n- 绕过微信的平台级封锁（这是微信主动区分\"真人用微信看\"和\"机器抓取\"的策略，跟反爬技术无关）\n\n---\n\n## 爬微信公众号的正确方式\n\n如果你的目标是**获取公众号文章内容**，真正可行的方案是：\n\n| 方式 | 说明 |\n|------|------|\n| **微信开放平台 API** | 官方接口，需要认证 |\n| **公众号后台** | 手动导出 |\n| **第三方聚合平台** | 如 微信公众号搜索、新榜等 |\n| **让你的 AI 助手读页面** | 就是今天这个场景——你在 VIA 看完分享给我 |\n\nScrapling 更适合爬取**普通网站的公开内容**，对微信这种\"平台主动封锁非微信环境\"的场景无能为力。\n\n你是有具体想爬的公众号内容吗？说说看，我帮你想想方案 😄"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":143,"output":514,"cacheRead":46283,"cacheWrite":285,"totalTokens":47225,"cost":{"input":0.0000429,"output":0.0006167999999999999,"cacheRead":0.0027769799999999996,"cacheWrite":0.00010687500000000001,"total":0.003543555}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778292831344,"responseId":"064dcb5f7a9984be7aa5bee3af398853"}}
