{"type":"message","id":"02bfdbfc","parentId":"19452f58","timestamp":"2026-05-09T02:15:44.187Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to open the WeChat article link in a browser and if there's a verification code, they'll provide it to me. But I already tried this earlier - when I opened the link with the browser, it redirected to a captcha page. Let me try again with the user's browser (profile=\"user\") since that would use their logged-in Chrome session which might be more trusted by WeChat.\n\nActually, let me think about this. The user is suggesting using \"谷歌浏览器\" (Google Chrome). In the OpenClaw browser tool, I can use `profile=\"user\"` to use the user's browser which might have their WeChat logged-in state. But actually, WeChat articles are opened in the WeChat client, not Chrome...\n\n\nWait, I need to clarify what the user means by \"谷歌浏览器\" - they might be referring to the Edge browser since it's commonly called \"谷歌浏览器\" in China, or they could mean the WeChat built-in browser. Either way, the earlier attempt with the sandbox browser hit the captcha wall, so using the user's local browser with their WeChat session cookies might work better.","thinkingSignature":"b449c23df602bc0b2b7ccb88fdc42fddb71ab9c4c9799baae8a7eb113c031e25"},{"type":"text","text":"好主意！让我试试用你的本地浏览器打开，这样可能会带着你的微信登录态。\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_2d67a402p9d8_1","name":"browser","arguments":{"action":"open","target":"host","profile":"user","targetUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/svac4tmdCl8Gp9kcvdV2OQ"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":143,"output":328,"cacheRead":46479,"cacheWrite":490,"totalTokens":47440,"cost":{"input":0.0000429,"output":0.00039359999999999997,"cacheRead":0.0027887399999999996,"cacheWrite":0.00018375,"total":0.0034089899999999993}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778292935123,"responseId":"064dcbc78bee0f260342be23efba4a0a"}}
{"type":"message","id":"9c761e1b","parentId":"02bfdbfc","timestamp":"2026-05-09T02:15:55.124Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_2d67a402p9d8_1","toolName":"browser","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"status\": \"error\",\n  \"tool\": \"browser\",\n  \"error\": \"Chrome MCP existing-session attach for profile \\\"user\\\" could not connect to Chrome. Enable remote debugging in the browser inspect page, keep the browser open, approve the attach prompt, and retry. If you do not need your signed-in browser session, use the managed \\\"openclaw\\\" profile instead. Last error: Could not connect to Chrome. Check if Chrome is running.\\nCause: Could not find DevToolsActivePort for chrome at /root/.config/google-chrome/DevToolsActivePort\"\n}"}],"details":{"status":"error","tool":"browser","error":"Chrome MCP existing-session attach for profile \"user\" could not connect to Chrome. Enable remote debugging in the browser inspect page, keep the browser open, approve the attach prompt, and retry. If you do not need your signed-in browser session, use the managed \"openclaw\" profile instead. Last error: Could not connect to Chrome. Check if Chrome is running.\nCause: Could not find DevToolsActivePort for chrome at /root/.config/google-chrome/DevToolsActivePort"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1778292955123}}
{"type":"message","id":"c9486617","parentId":"9c761e1b","timestamp":"2026-05-09T02:16:02.715Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user's Chrome browser isn't running or doesn't have remote debugging enabled. Let me try with the \"openclaw\" profile which is the managed browser. But we know that one gets blocked by WeChat. Let me try it and see if the captcha page shows a \"send code\" button.\n\nActually, let me just try opening with the openclaw profile (the isolated browser) and see what happens. If there's a captcha with a \"send verification code\" option, I'll click it and tell the user.","thinkingSignature":"c41ed63a731cba9e3de7e093bb0ed0afa2384b2460f104d7ec37f7c7f00b76ac"},{"type":"text","text":"你电脑上的 Chrome 没有运行，或者没开远程调试。让我用隔离浏览器试试看验证码页面有没有\"发送验证码\"的按钮：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_n5rzuly4j2pm_1","name":"browser","arguments":{"action":"open","target":"host","targetUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/svac4tmdCl8Gp9kcvdV2OQ"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":29508,"output":200,"cacheRead":18026,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":47734,"cost":{"input":0.0088524,"output":0.00023999999999999998,"cacheRead":0.0010815599999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.010173960000000001}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778292955125,"responseId":"064dcbdb18c240e3d887ba24521a5b76"}}
