{"type":"message","id":"28aa27a9","parentId":"b367f1a6","timestamp":"2026-05-09T02:18:08.263Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I can see there's a captcha iframe that opened - `https://captcha.gtimg.com/static/template/drag_ele.19c98519.html`. This is a Tencent captcha (Gtimg is Tencent's captcha service). Let me try to take a screenshot of this iframe to see what kind of captcha it is.Actually, let me focus on the current tab (t4) and then try to interact with the captcha. But this captcha is likely a \"点选验证码\" (click-based captcha) or a \"滑动验证码\" (drag-based captcha), which I cannot easily solve.\n\nLet me take a screenshot of the current tab to see the current state.","thinkingSignature":"e87cd257c52fafa51aff4730314979478c79f97167b2c6f1b21a64802c848948"},{"type":"text","text":"弹出验证码窗口了！让我看看是什么类型的验证码：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_ip4fybpypil2_1","name":"browser","arguments":{"action":"screenshot","targetId":"14EF9BF7CF6C07B56D5F6DF5720550B6"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":34254,"output":212,"cacheRead":18026,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":52492,"cost":{"input":0.0102762,"output":0.0002544,"cacheRead":0.0010815599999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.01161216}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778293082056,"responseId":"064dcc5a0abfcd272055940e9bd6486e"}}
{"type":"message","id":"5b198cae","parentId":"28aa27a9","timestamp":"2026-05-09T02:18:08.588Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_ip4fybpypil2_1","toolName":"browser","content":[{"type":"image","data":"","mimeType":"image/png"}],"details":{"path":"/opt/cclaw-client/UbuntuClaw/cclaw/data/media/browser/0bf4adce-5aaf-4853-9c95-b598005b2232.png","ok":true,"targetId":"14EF9BF7CF6C07B56D5F6DF5720550B6","url":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/wappoc_appmsgcaptcha?poc_token=HFGZ_mmjgmbqh1y_7I1lMWPYp0ql-eFf5XjsRHvx&target_url=https%3A%2F%2Fmp.weixin.qq.com%2Fs%2Fsvac4tmdCl8Gp9kcvdV2OQ%3F","media":{"mediaUrl":"/opt/cclaw-client/UbuntuClaw/cclaw/data/media/browser/0bf4adce-5aaf-4853-9c95-b598005b2232.png"}},"isError":false,"timestamp":1778293088588}}
{"type":"message","id":"ae21e162","parentId":"5b198cae","timestamp":"2026-05-09T02:18:19.842Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The screenshot couldn't be processed. But I know from the tabs that the captcha is at `https://captcha.gtimg.com/static/template/drag_ele.19c98519.html` which suggests it's a drag-based (slider) captcha. \"drag_ele\" = drag element.\n\nThis is a Tencent slider captcha - you need to drag a small image to complete a puzzle. These are very difficult to solve programmatically because they require:\n1. Detecting the position of the gap/slot\n2. Calculating the correct drag distance\n3. Simulating human-like mouse movement\n\nEven if I could somehow solve it, the verification is tied to your IP and browser environment, and even if the captcha passes, the session would still be rejected because the server would still see we're on a server IP, not a residential one.\n\n\nI've hit a dead end here - the combination of Tencent's slider captcha, the server IP, and the missing WeChat login session means I can't bypass this verification through programmatic means.","thinkingSignature":"c47942cfded0854d84ac79960d80f4dc58027ff5b91e9cc4d6d7bc3b3210ce6b"},{"type":"text","text":"看到了，是**滑动验证码**（腾讯 Gtimg 的拖动拼图）。就是让你把一个小块拖到正确位置完成拼图的那种。\n\n---\n\n**坏消息：这种验证码我搞不定 😕**\n\n原因：\n1. **滑动验证码需要真人操作** — 我可以模拟拖动，但每次拼图的位置都是随机的，我没法知道该拖到哪里\n2. **验证是跟着 IP 的** — 就算验证码通过了，微信服务器还是会识别我是服务器 IP，不是你的手机/电脑 IP，一样被拒\n\n---\n\n**你的方案行不通**，核心问题不在验证码，而在于：**微信从 IP 层面就判断我是\"机器\"，根本不是\"真人用微信\"**，验证码只是多重验证中的一环。\n\n最省事的办法还是：**你在 VIA 浏览器看完，觉得好就分享给我**，就像今天开头那样 ✅"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":34491,"output":383,"cacheRead":18026,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":52900,"cost":{"input":0.0103473,"output":0.0004596,"cacheRead":0.0010815599999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.01188846}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778293088590,"responseId":"064dcc60909e8b4d6a9852b74b838eff"}}
