CloakBrowser/tree/main/bin)\\n\\n[bin](/CloakHQ/CloakBrowser/tree/main/bin)\\n\\n \\n \\n\\n[cloakbrowser](/CloakHQ/CloakBrowser/tree/main/cloakbrowser)\\n\\n[cloakbrowser](/CloakHQ/CloakBrowser/tree/main/cloakbrowser)\\n\\n \\n \\n\\n[examples](/CloakHQ/CloakBrowser/tree/main/examples)\\n\\n[examples](/CloakHQ/CloakBrowser/tree/main/examples)\\n\\n \\n \\n\\n[images](/CloakHQ/CloakBrowser/tree/main/images)\\n\\n[images](/CloakHQ/CloakBrowser/tree/main/images)\\n\\n \\n \\n\\n[js](/CloakHQ/CloakBrowser/tree/main/js)\\n\\n[js](/CloakHQ/CloakBrowser/tree/main/js)\\n\\n \\n \\n\\n[tests](/CloakHQ/CloakBrowser/tree/main/tests)\\n\\n[tests](/CloakHQ/CloakBrowser/tree/main/tests)\\n\\n \\n \\n\\n[.gitattributes](/CloakHQ/CloakBrowser/blob/main/.gitattributes)\\n\\n[.gitattributes](/CloakHQ/CloakBrowser/blob/main/.gitattributes)\\n\\n \\n \\n\\n[.gitignore](/CloakHQ/CloakBrowser/blob/main/.gitignore)\\n\\n[.gitignore](/CloakHQ/CloakBrowser/blob/main/.gitignore)\\n\\n \\n \\n\\n[BINARY-LICENSE.md](/CloakHQ/CloakBrowser/blob/main/BINARY-LICENSE.md)\\n\\n[BINARY-LICENSE.md](/CloakHQ/CloakBrowser/blob/main/BINARY-LICENSE.md)\\n\\n \\n \\n\\n[CHANGELOG.md](/CloakHQ/CloakBrowser/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md)\\n\\n[CHANGELOG.md](/CloakHQ/CloakBrowser/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md)\\n\\n \\n \\n\\n[Dockerfile](/CloakHQ/CloakBrowser/blob/main/Dockerfile)\\n\\n[Dockerfile](/CloakHQ/CloakBrowser/blob/main/Dockerfile)\\n\\n \\n \\n\\n[LICENSE](/CloakHQ/CloakBrowser/blob/main/LICENSE)\\n\\n[LICENSE](/CloakHQ/CloakBrowser/blob/main/LICENSE)\\n\\n \\n \\n\\n[README.md](/CloakHQ/CloakBrowser/blob/main/README.md)\\n\\n[README.md](/CloakHQ/CloakBrowser/blob/main/README.md)\\n\\n \\n \\n\\n[pyproject.toml](/CloakHQ/CloakBrowser/blob/main/pyproject.toml)\\n\\n[pyproject.toml](/CloakHQ/CloakBrowser/blob/main/pyproject.toml)\\n\\n \\n \\n\\nView all files\\n\\n## Repository files navigation\\n\\n- [README](#)\\n- [MIT license](#)\\n\\nhttps://camo.githubusercontent.com/43781a18d7166adfa1b725bbc84c37994876f34d5bf6d429e92fd35ddb11444f/68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f63716b703666472e706e67\\n\\nhttps://pypi.org/project/cloakbrowser/\\nhttps://www.npmjs.com/package/cloakbrowser\\n/CloakHQ/CloakBrowser/blob/main/LICENSE\\nhttps://github.com/CloakHQ/CloakBrowser\\n\\nhttps://github.com/CloakHQ/CloakBrowser\\nhttps://pypi.org/project/cloakbrowser/\\nhttps://www.npmjs.com/package/cloakbrowser\\nhttps://hub.docker.com/r/cloakhq/cloakbrowser\\n\\nhttps://ko-fi.com/cloakhq\\n\\n### Stealth Chromium that passes every bot detection test.\\n#stealth-chromium-that-passes-every-bot-detection-test\\n\\nNot a patched config. Not a JS injection. A real Chromium binary with fingerprints modified at the C++ source level. Antibot systems score it as a normal browser — because it is a normal browser.\\n\\nhttps://camo.githubusercontent.com/e62e994d725c2bb03c55e3ccc1cdd4f9fc15df681764d7547d5d909c535bf389/68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f497642304974372e676966\\n\\nCloudflare Turnstile — 3 live tests passing (headed mode, macOS)\\n\\nDrop-in Playwright/Puppeteer replacement for Python and JavaScript.\\n\\nSame API, same code — just swap the import. 3 lines of code, 30 seconds to unblock.\\n\\n- 49 source-level C++ patches — canvas, WebGL, audio, fonts, GPU, screen, WebRTC, network timing, automation signals, CDP input behavior\\n\\n- humanize=True — human-like mouse curves, keyboard timing, and scroll patterns. One flag, behavioral detection passes\\n\\n- 0.9 reCAPTCHA v3 score — human-level, server-verified\\n\\n- Passes Cloudflare Turnstile, FingerprintJS, BrowserScan — tested against 30+ detection sites\\n\\n- Auto-updating binary — background update checks, always on the latest stealth build\\n\\n- pip install cloakbrowser or npm install cloakbrowser — binary auto-downloads, zero config\\n\\n- Free and open source — no subscriptions, no usage limits\\n\\nTry it now — no install needed:\\n\\ndocker run --rm cloakhq/cloakbrowser cloaktest\\n\\nPython:\\n\\nfrom cloakbrowser import launch\\n\\nbrowser = launch()\\npage = browser.new_page()\\npage.goto(\\\"https://protected-site.com\\\") # no more blocks\\nbrowser.close()\\n\\nJavaScript (Playwright):\\n\\nimport { launch } from 'cloakbrowser';\\n\\nconst browser = await launch();\\nconst page = await browser.newPage();\\nawait page.goto('https://protected-site.com');\\nawait browser.close();\\n\\nAlso works with Puppeteer: import { launch } from 'cloakbrowser/puppeteer' ([details](#puppeteer))\\n\\n## Install\\n#install\\n\\nPython:\\n\\npip install cloakbrowser\\n\\nJavaScript / Node.js\n\n⚠️ [... middle content omitted — showing head and tail ...]\n\nroof\\n#proof\\n\\nhttps://camo.githubusercontent.com/feded3374c1c5ed60ddf62fa0f69588539c77d1395918682716fffc46b181354/68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f68764951794d762e706e67\\n\\nreCAPTCHA v3 score 0.9 — server-side verified (human-level)\\n\\nhttps://camo.githubusercontent.com/63c5bf6299894c50429329210d34d1d570d124b2bf1be567e9b53e50293826cb/68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f714d49526668712e706e67\\n\\nCloudflare Turnstile non-interactive challenge — auto-resolved\\n\\nhttps://camo.githubusercontent.com/b0021eb94d49a0844538b66d4ac8d0f5b6d9402225160b689d474473a6418555/68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f505273773672542e706e67\\n\\nBrowserScan bot detection — NORMAL (4/4 checks passed)\\n\\nhttps://camo.githubusercontent.com/e5ae2119c02c77cea372a199e10694620ad50a7b0d1e0b4fa9d4a2632f9ff3c3/68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f396e32433774752e706e67\\n\\nFingerprintJS web-scraping demo — data served, not blocked\\n\\nhttps://camo.githubusercontent.com/9dd7d951c691cae639bb7ce70e618d8642354c7d3c2e2b8fd770ec7e0688195f/68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f7372436346744b2e706e67\\n\\ndeviceandbrowserinfo.com behavioral bot detection — \\\"You are human!\\\" with humanize=True (24/24 signals passed)\\n\\n## Comparison\\n#comparison\\n\\nFeature\\nPlaywright\\nplaywright-stealth\\nundetected-chromedriver\\nCamoufox\\nCloakBrowser\\n\\nreCAPTCHA v3 score\\n0.1\\n0.3-0.5\\n0.3-0.7\\n0.7-0.9\\n0.9\\n\\nCloudflare Turnstile\\nFail\\nSometimes\\nSometimes\\nPass\\nPass\\n\\nPatch level\\nNone\\nJS injection\\nConfig patches\\nC++ (Firefox)\\nC++ (Chromium)\\n\\nSurvives Chrome updates\\nN/A\\nBreaks often\\nBreaks often\\nYes\\nYes\\n\\nMaintained\\nYes\\nStale\\nStale\\nUnstable\\nActive\\n\\nBrowser engine\\nChromium\\nChromium\\nChrome\\nFirefox\\nChromium\\n\\nPlaywright API\\nNative\\nNative\\nNo (Selenium)\\nNo\\nNative\\n\\n## How It Works\\n#how-it-works\\n\\nCloakBrowser is a thin wrapper (Python + JavaScript) around a custom-built Chromium binary:\\n\\n- You install → pip install cloakbrowser or npm install cloakbrowser\\n\\n- First launch → binary auto-downloads for your platform (Chromium 146)\\n\\n- Every launch → Playwright or Puppeteer starts with our binary + stealth args\\n\\n- You write code → standard Playwright/Puppeteer API, nothing new to learn\\n\\nThe binary includes 49 source-level patches covering canvas, WebGL, audio, fonts, GPU, screen properties, WebRTC, network timing, hardware reporting, automation signal removal, and CDP input behavior mimicking.\\n\\nThese are compiled into the Chromium binary — not injected via JavaScript, not set via flags.\\n\\nBinary downloads are verified with SHA-256 checksums to ensure integrity.\\n\\n## API\\n#api\\n\\n### launch()\\n#launch\\n\\nfrom cloakbrowser import launch\\n\\n# Basic — headless, default stealth config\\nbrowser = launch()\\n\\n# Headed mode (see the browser window)\\nbrowser = launch(headless=False)\\n\\n# With proxy (HTTP or SOCKS5)\\nbrowser = launch(proxy=\\\"http://user:pass@proxy:8080\\\")\\nbrowser = launch(proxy=\\\"socks5://user:pass@proxy:1080\\\")\\n\\n# With proxy dict (bypass, separate auth fields)\\nbrowser = launch(proxy={\\\"server\\\": \\\"http://proxy:8080\\\", \\\"bypass\\\": \\\".google.com\\\", \\\"username\\\": \\\"user\\\", \\\"password\\\": \\\"pass\\\"})\\n\\n# With extra Chrome args\\nbrowser = launch(args=[\\\"--disable-gpu\\\"])\\n\\n# With timezone and locale (sets binary flags — no detectable CDP emulation)\\nbrowser = launch(timezone=\\\"America/New_York\\\", locale=\\\"en-US\\\")\\n\\n# Auto-detect timezone/locale from proxy IP (requires: pip install cloakbrowser[geoip])\\n# Also auto-injects --fingerprint-webrtc-ip to prevent WebRTC IP leaks (no extra cost)\\n# Note: makes HTTP calls through your proxy to resolve exit IP (ipify.org, checkip.amazonaws.com)\\nbrowser = launch(proxy=\\\"http://proxy:8080\\\", geoip=True)\\n\\n# Explicit timezone/locale always win over auto-detection\\nbrowser = launch(proxy=\\\"http://proxy:8080\\\", geoip=True, timezone=\\\"Europe/London\\\")\\n\\n# WebRTC IP spoofing only (no geoip dep needed — resolves exit IP\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"f21276348c0998b7\\\">>>\"\n}[... 5557 more characters truncated]"}],"details":{"persistedDetailsTruncated":true,"originalDetailsBytesAtLeast":8193,"originalDetailKeys":["url","finalUrl","status","contentType","title","extractMode","extractor","externalContent","truncated","length","rawLength","wrappedLength","fetchedAt","tookMs","text","warning"],"status":200,"truncated":true},"isError":false,"timestamp":1778297513714}}
{"type":"message","id":"461e1cf3","parentId":"1db191af","timestamp":"2026-05-09T03:32:16.290Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I have enough information about CloakBrowser now. Let me provide a comprehensive introduction.","thinkingSignature":"eab5ec2524706ea177602ca31e32dd35fc4fc2a1a457f51a27c880de0bcb288b"},{"type":"text","text":"# CloakBrowser 详细介绍\n\n## 它是什么\n\n**CloakBrowser** 是一个\"隐身 Chromium\"，核心卖点就一句：**通过修改 Chromium 源码（C++ 级别）来隐藏自动化指纹，使其通过所有反爬检测**。\n\n口号是 *\"Not a patched config. Not a JS injection. A real Chromium binary.\"*\n\n---\n\n## 核心特点\n\n| 能力 | 说明 |\n|------|------|\n| **30/30 测试通过** | 已在 reCAPTCHA v3、Cloudflare Turnstile、FingerprintJS、BrowserScan 等 30+ 检测平台验证 |\n| **reCAPTCHA v3 得分 0.9** | 普通 Playwright 得 0.1（被识别为机器人），它得 0.9（人类级别） |\n| **源码级 49 个补丁** | 覆盖 canvas、WebGL、audio、fonts、GPU、screen、WebRTC、网络时序、自动化信号等 |\n| **一行代码替换** | 把 `from playwright.sync_api import sync_playwright` 换成 `from cloakbrowser import launch`，其他代码不变 |\n| **humanize=True** | 一个参数让鼠标曲线、键盘时序、滚动都模拟真人行为 |\n| **自动更新** | 后台检查更新，始终保持最新隐身版本 |\n\n---\n\n## 和同类工具对比\n\n| | Playwright | playwright-stealth | undetected-chromedriver | CloakBrowser |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| reCAPTCHA v3 得分 | 0.1 | 0.3~0.5 | 0.3~0.7 | **0.9** |\n| Cloudflare Turnstile | 失败 | 有时成功 | 有时成功 | **通过** |\n| 补丁层级 | 无 | JS 注入 | 配置补丁 | **C++ 源码** |\n| Chrome 更新后 | — | 容易坏 | 容易坏 | **稳定** |\n\n---\n\n## 工作原理\n\n普通的\"隐身浏览器\"工具（stealth 脚本之类）都是**在浏览器启动后用 JS 注入来伪装指纹**，Chrome 更新一次就可能全部失效。\n\nCloakBrowser 的做法是直接**修改 Chromium 源码**，把指纹伪造编译进二进制文件里。从底层来说，它就是一个\"看起来像正常 Chrome\"的 Chrome，所以检测工具拿它没办法。\n\n---\n\n## 安装使用\n\n**Python：**\n```python\npip install cloakbrowser\n\nfrom cloakbrowser import launch\nbrowser = launch()\npage = browser.new_page()\npage.goto(\"https://protected-site.com\")\n```\n\n**JavaScript（Playwright）：**\n```js\nnpm install cloakbrowser playwright-core\nimport { launch } from 'cloakbrowser';\nconst browser = await launch();\nconst page = await browser.newPage();\nawait page.goto('https://protected-site.com');\n```\n\n---\n\n## 配合 AI Agent 使用\n\n支持 browser-use、Crawl4AI、Scrapling、Stagehand、LangChain、Selenium 等框架，也就是之前聊的 playwright-cli、Scrapling 这类工具都可以无缝集成 CloakBrowser 来绕过反爬。\n\n---\n\n## 总结\n\n如果你需要**让 AI 控制的浏览器不被网站识别为机器人**，CloakBrowser 是一个很强的选择。它解决的是\"浏览器指纹被识别\"这个根本问题，而不是像传统方案那样打补丁。\n\n不过它**不解决验证码**（只是防止验证码出现），也不内置代理轮换——这些需要自己配合使用。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":39936,"output":716,"cacheRead":18026,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":58678,"cost":{"input":0.0119808,"output":0.0008592,"cacheRead":0.0010815599999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.01392156}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778297513717,"responseId":"064ddda9fac926ac908d403e6ba6e66e"}}
