{"type":"message","id":"2cf49bdd","parentId":"393cd115","timestamp":"2026-05-09T03:37:48.670Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The CloakBrowser binary download is failing. The primary download timed out, then it tried GitHub Releases, and that seems to be hanging too. This is likely a network issue in this server environment (China-based server having trouble reaching the CloakBrowser download servers).\n\nThe package itself is installed, but the actual stealth Chromium binary can't be downloaded due to network issues.\n\nLet me inform the user of the situation.","thinkingSignature":"e5cd2d1834101a58e1cb786306b4220a45ba9760eeb3664a076a0a10c024b212"},{"type":"text","text":"**安装好了，但下载浏览器内核失败了。**\n\n情况是这样的：\n\n- ✅ `cloakbrowser 0.3.27` Python 包安装成功\n- ❌ 第一次运行时会自动下载定制 Chromium 二进制文件（约几百 MB），但**下载超时了**\n\n原因应该是这个服务器在大陆，访问 CloakBrowser 的下载源比较慢或者超时了。\n\n**可以试试：**\n\n1. **给你的电脑（网络好）安装** — 在你自己电脑上 `pip install cloakbrowser`，然后运行一次让它自动下载二进制，会顺畅很多\n\n2. **或者试试 Docker 方式**（不需要手动下载二进制）：\n   ```bash\n   docker run --rm cloakhq/cloakbrowser cloaktest\n   ```\n\n3. **或者等网络好一点再重试** — 这个服务器出口带宽不稳定\n\n---\n\n你想试试哪种方式？还是你就是想在你电脑上装？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":45856,"output":264,"cacheRead":18026,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":64146,"cost":{"input":0.0137568,"output":0.0003168,"cacheRead":0.0010815599999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.01515516}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778297859251,"responseId":"064ddf0358a09f05377fecf6cfcee5c3"}}
