{"type":"message","id":"f00f84d7","parentId":"0d2a1074","timestamp":"2026-05-09T03:40:00.952Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants to download the CloakBrowser binary on their local machine (which has good internet access) and then send it to me to install. That's a great idea! Let me figure out what files need to be downloaded and where they go.\n\nCloakBrowser downloads a custom Chromium binary. When installed via pip, it downloads the binary on first run. The binary is stored in a platform-specific location.\n\nLet me check what the CloakBrowser package expects - the binary path and what file it downloads. I should look at the cloakbrowser package to understand the binary download process.","thinkingSignature":"3c7b305e4f252022fa81973ab45e7c352dad2d3ae5044c8c4179ea6985cc27cc"},{"type":"text","text":"\n好主意！让我先看看 CloakBrowser 需要什么文件、从哪里下载：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_qfa97nj12dsq_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 -c \"\nimport cloakbrowser\nimport os\n# 看看二进制下载相关的代码\nimport cloakbrowser.helpers as h\nprint(dir(h))\n\" 2>&1 | head -30","timeout":10}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":143,"output":209,"cacheRead":18026,"cacheWrite":45301,"totalTokens":63679,"cost":{"input":0.0000429,"output":0.00025079999999999997,"cacheRead":0.0010815599999999999,"cacheWrite":0.016987875,"total":0.018363135}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778297991584,"responseId":"064ddf87903fd023feb84d3359f4fd4d"}}
