{"type":"message","id":"4053e945","parentId":"cfa32acd","timestamp":"2026-05-09T03:45:43.852Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Excellent! The CloakBrowser is working correctly:\n\n1. WebGL renderer shows a real GPU (NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4060) instead of a virtual/special renderer - this is what a real Chrome would show\n2. `navigator.webdriver` is `False` - this is the key flag that Playwright normally sets to `True` that identifies automation\n\nThis confirms CloakBrowser is successfully masking the automation signals. Let me summarize the results.","thinkingSignature":"9d2561f3fa5c0d4d5cc9786a23ba37e92a9f26ade5e65759c01b6809b0403ac7"},{"type":"text","text":"**CloakBrowser 安装成功，测试通过！**\n\n关键指标：\n\n| 检查项 | 普通 Playwright | CloakBrowser |\n|--------|---------------|-------------|\n| WebGL 渲染器 | SwiftShader（虚拟） | **NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4060**（真实独显） |\n| navigator.webdriver | true（暴露自动化） | **false**（伪装成真浏览器） |\n\nWebGL 显示的是真实 RTX 4060 显卡，说明源码级补丁生效了——它不是靠 JS 注入伪装，是真的修改了 Chromium 的渲染行为。\n\n---\n\n**总结：CloakBrowser 已就绪，以后需要爬被反爬封锁的网站时直接用就行！** 🎉"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":57032,"output":241,"cacheRead":18026,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":75299,"cost":{"input":0.0171096,"output":0.0002892,"cacheRead":0.0010815599999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.018480359999999998}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778298334595,"responseId":"064de0dec1bd17e616c3d2ca72f16302"}}
