{"type":"message","id":"c3365fe2","parentId":"b08a4c86","timestamp":"2026-05-09T04:17:27.315Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"playwright-cli is working and successfully opened baidu.com. Let me report back to the user.\n","thinkingSignature":"4ee26ed05a2cb926c9b61ca0531949bd334832f6b18b69335d6d6713ddf1662b"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**安装成功！** ✅\n\n```\n@playwright/cli@latest 已安装\nplaywright-cli install --skills 完成（下载了 FFmpeg + Chrome）\n```\n\n顺手测了一下——`playwright-cli open https://www.baidu.com` 直接跑通，百度首页打开正常。\n\n---\n\n**注意**：playwright-cli 主要是给 **Claude Code 这类 AI 编程 Agent** 用的控制台工具，不是图形界面。如果你想要AI编程/自动化场景的浏览器控制，用它；如果只是让我帮你操作浏览器，**继续用我内置的 agent-browser 就行**，不需要 playwright-cli。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":242,"output":142,"cacheRead":81248,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":81632,"cost":{"input":0.0000726,"output":0.0001704,"cacheRead":0.00487488,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00511788}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778300242519,"responseId":"064de852a2a4a3cde653c0ef3d5fd257"}}
