{"type":"message","id":"0b754552","parentId":"fac99caa","timestamp":"2026-05-09T04:19:06.379Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_y6aou2glq95g_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"### Ran Playwright code\n```js\nawait page.getByRole('button', { name: '同意并授权' }).click();\n```\n### Page\n- Page URL: https://gez.dongguanbank.cn/landlord/#/login\n- Page Title: 莞e租管理系统\n### Snapshot\n- [Snapshot](.playwright-cli/page-2026-05-09T04-19-06-366Z.yml)"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":1198,"aggregated":"### Ran Playwright code\n```js\nawait page.getByRole('button', { name: '同意并授权' }).click();\n```\n### Page\n- Page URL: https://gez.dongguanbank.cn/landlord/#/login\n- Page Title: 莞e租管理系统\n### Snapshot\n- [Snapshot](.playwright-cli/page-2026-05-09T04-19-06-366Z.yml)","cwd":"/opt/cclaw-client/UbuntuClaw/cclaw/data/workspaces/coordinator"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1778300346379}}
