{"type":"message","id":"9bb1cb20","parentId":"c159fb66","timestamp":"2026-05-09T04:19:09.944Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_8u8gobtxc0th_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"### Ran Playwright code\n```js\nawait page.getByRole('textbox', { name: '请输入您的手机号码' }).fill('18926879306');\n```\n### Ran Playwright code\n```js\nawait page.getByRole('textbox', { name: '请输入您的密码' }).fill('100911yzpYZP');\n```"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":322,"aggregated":"### Ran Playwright code\n```js\nawait page.getByRole('textbox', { name: '请输入您的手机号码' }).fill('18926879306');\n```\n### Ran Playwright code\n```js\nawait page.getByRole('textbox', { name: '请输入您的密码' }).fill('100911yzpYZP');\n```","cwd":"/opt/cclaw-client/UbuntuClaw/cclaw/data/workspaces/coordinator"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1778300349944}}
