{"type":"message","id":"94836f7e","parentId":"fb7055aa","timestamp":"2026-05-09T04:27:13.333Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Got the rental details for room 428! Let me summarize the results.","thinkingSignature":"b68ce5ccfdb011c933e13864e71389a5eab2c7f73fcebb38474b9aa8a9e8f75a"},{"type":"text","text":"找到了！用 agent-browser 同样查到了结果：\n\n---\n\n**428 房间租期：2025/02/13 - 2026/05/31**\n\n| 项目 | 信息 |\n|------|------|\n| **租期** | 2025/02/13 - **2026/05/31** |\n| **租约状态** | 即将到期 |\n| **承租人** | 杜帅帅 |\n| **承租人电话** | 13129498687 |\n| **租金** | 850.00 元/月 |\n\n---\n\n两种工具结果一致 ✅\n\n**对比一下两个工具的操作体验：**\n\n| | playwright-cli | agent-browser |\n|---|---|---|\n| 填写表单 | `fill` 直接填入值 | `type` 逐字输入（fill 偶发失效） |\n| refs 稳定性 | 每次 snapshot 重新生成 | 每次 snapshot 重新生成 |\n| 交互方式 | 命令行风格，适合 AI | 动作驱动，适合精细控制 |\n| 登录流程 | 顺畅 | 略曲折（type 比 fill 可靠） |\n\n**结论**：这个场景下 **playwright-cli 操作更简洁直接**，命令行交互比 agent-browser 的 `act` 动作更稳定。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":89712,"output":273,"cacheRead":18938,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":108923,"cost":{"input":0.0269136,"output":0.0003276,"cacheRead":0.00113628,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.02837748}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778300825537,"responseId":"064dea9982424e692aec9a2ffa3e4835"}}
