{"type":"message","id":"33039965","parentId":"09471ca9","timestamp":"2026-05-09T04:37:57.436Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to default to using playwright-cli for browser operations, and only fall back to agent-browser if playwright-cli has issues. I should remember this and update the memory files.","thinkingSignature":"333140640e5ac0913bb63b5262df6fb2a4ec2884c3e7ae2dea3d446cd075c7be"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_2px83fxw93f7_1","name":"edit","arguments":{"path":"/opt/cclaw-client/UbuntuClaw/cclaw/data/workspaces/coordinator/MEMORY.md","edits":[{"oldText":"## 经验总结\n\n1. **优先用 agent-browser** — OpenClaw 内置，无需额外安装\n2. **被强反爬拦死时换 CloakBrowser** — 特别是微信公众平台\n3. **普通网站被抓不到数据时** — 试试降低请求频率、加 header\n4. **验证码问题** — 滑动类基本无解，点选类可尝试打码平台\n5. **IP 问题** — 换代理，但成本高，优先尝试其他方法","newText":"## 浏览器操作工具优先级\n\n1. **优先用 playwright-cli** — 操作简洁、命令直观，适合 AI Agent 场景\n2. ** playwright-cli 遇到问题时用 agent-browser** — OpenClaw 内置，适合精细控制\n3. **被强反爬拦死时用 CloakBrowser** — 特别是微信公众平台\n4. **普通网站被抓不到数据时** — 试试降低请求频率、加 header\n5. **验证码问题** — 滑动类基本无解，点选类可尝试打码平台\n6. **IP 问题** — 换代理，但成本高，优先尝试其他方法"}]}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":143,"output":339,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":107360,"totalTokens":107842,"cost":{"input":0.0000429,"output":0.00040679999999999997,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0.040260000000000004,"total":0.0407097}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778301467191,"responseId":"064ded1bed6ca3d7f38b45463f737fea"}}
